From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: Support official OptiScaler nightlies.

Add floating and pinned nightly selections with verified, cached downloads
of the official package and a pinned static 7-Zip extractor. Keep the
nightly's bundled libraries separate from managed upscaler DLLs.

Stage package updates before replacing installed files, roll back failed
replacements, and allow local validation without release metadata. Keep
stable version selection unchanged and never substitute another pinned
nightly. Cover bootstrap, updates and failure paths with isolated tests.

---
